Error [E0392]: `.Ok(.Val(user))` wraps a state that `User? DBError!` names directly
  --> tests/ui/outcome_nested_ok_retired.jet:21:9
    |
 21 |         .Ok(.Val(user)) -> print(user.name)
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A `T? E!` value has three states, matched as `.Val(x)`, `.None` and `.Err(e)`
 Fix: Write `.Val(user)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0392

